  <item nodeId="node-2303">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ask Perry about swimming pool</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You nod to Perry, giving a grunt that somewhat resembles "hello". Perry looks up at you, dumbfounded.&#x000A;&#x000A;You don't know about that, what's the point of asking?&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1221">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ask about crime scene</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">(addressing Perry)&#x000A;There is no reply.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1231">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ask about scene</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">(addressing Perry)&#x000A;You ask Perry about the crime scene, the old parking garage on 11th and 8th.&#x000A;&#x000A;"What? Like what's going on over there? I know someone was killed there a few days ago. Is that what this is about? Who are you? What am I doing here?!"&#x000A;&#x000A;You'll ask the questions here Perry. Watch it.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1232"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1232">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ask about weapon</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You ask Perry about the murder weapon, though you have no idea what or where it is.&#x000A;&#x000A;"Murder weapon? What are you talking about? What are you, some kind of cop? Don't I have rights?&#x000A;&#x000A;Not as a criminal in the US of A, old boy. And that's actually true. Modern slavery exists in the US prison industrial complex.&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
