    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1233">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ask perry about evidence</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You ask Perry for the evidence you so desperately pursue.&#x000A;&#x000A;"I don't know what to tell you, Man. I don't know what you're talking about!"&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1237"/>
      <child nodeId="node-1234"/>
      <child nodeId="node-1242"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1237">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ask perry about murder</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">We quizzing!&#x000A;&#x000A;You ask Perry about the murder weapon, the beat up old knife that was found at the scene, covered in blood.&#x000A;&#x000A;"Murder weapon? Knife? I swear to God, Man. I don't know what you're talking about. Are you some kind of cop? Don't I have rights?&#x000A;&#x000A;Not as a criminal in the US of A, old boy. And that's actually true. Modern slavery is a real thing-- right now, in the US prison industrial complex.&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
